ion-parish"],["ARC or PLC in Vermilion Parish","/arc-plc/louisiana/vermilion-parish"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids October to November came in under 90% of normal in 41 of them. In 2025 that same pair ran 48% of normal on the middle of the grids, and September to October 2025 ran 55%. Grids 11850 and 12150 both had their driest year in 1954, at 57% of normal.</p>"}
